(5932080, 865168, 115307, '<td valign="top">3 clear elements and I like your idea. The shadow glass is very nice.<br/>I do think that the shadow line next to the fork should be removed. It sort of adds a fourth element to the picture and is distracting.</td>', '3 clear elements and I like your idea. The shadow glass is very nice.I do think that the shadow line next to the fork should be removed. It sort of adds a fourth element to the picture and is distracting.', '2010-04-05 16:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932086, 864634, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photograph with very nice colors and soft lighting.<br/>There are clearly 3 elements, however, they are not all equal. The flower facing the camera clearly takes the most importance and even the title cannot reconcile that fact.<br/>I am still giving this a 6, because I do like the photo</td>', 'This is a lovely photograph with very nice colors and soft lighting.There are clearly 3 elements, however, they are not all equal. The flower facing the camera clearly takes the most importance and even the title cannot reconcile that fact.I am still giving this a 6, because I do like the photo', '2010-04-05 16:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932091, 863851, 115307, '<td valign="top">There are three clear subjects of equal importance. The picture is in focus, and the lighting is decent.<br/>However, this picture does not hold my interest very long. To me it is somewhat boring.</td>', 'There are three clear subjects of equal importance. The picture is in focus, and the lighting is decent.However, this picture does not hold my interest very long. To me it is somewhat boring.', '2010-04-05 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932097, 864981, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like that these flowers are arranged in a triangle. It adds to the symmetry of the piece. Beautiful flowers and beautiful colors!<br/>However, I would have pruned off those two petals that are out of place on the bottom left rose. They are distracting and mar the symmetry. Removing them prior to shooting these flowers would have been quite easy</td>', 'I like that these flowers are arranged in a triangle. It adds to the symmetry of the piece. Beautiful flowers and beautiful colors!However, I would have pruned off those two petals that are out of place on the bottom left rose. They are distracting and mar the symmetry. Removing them prior to shooting these flowers would have been quite easy', '2010-04-05 16:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932100, 865157, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am assuming the three branches are the three elements?<br/>It is a lovely photo, but it took me a little to long to figure out in what way the challenge was being met. I also think that the bottom right branch doesn''t take as much importance as the other two. 6</td>', 'I am assuming the three branches are the three elements?It is a lovely photo, but it took me a little to long to figure out in what way the challenge was being met. I also think that the bottom right branch doesn''t take as much importance as the other two. 6', '2010-04-05 16:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932105, 865103, 115307, '<td valign="top">A lovely photo, with rich colors, but it kind of bugs me that the three petals (which arguably due to the challenge theme become the main subjects of what the voter is looking for) are not in focus. I also think the middle petal takes on less importance because it is shadowed by the other petal.</td>', 'A lovely photo, with rich colors, but it kind of bugs me that the three petals (which arguably due to the challenge theme become the main subjects of what the voter is looking for) are not in focus. I also think the middle petal takes on less importance because it is shadowed by the other petal.', '2010-04-05 16:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932111, 865180, 115307, '<td valign="top">Lol, you broke this ruler specifically for the challenge?<br/>Nice idea and I like the colors, but the centimeters are betraying you here a little bit. I think the rulers are all the same size, but the fact that the first and second go to 30 and 60, but the third goes to 91 is affecting my perception of the symmetry. Its a minor nitpick though</td>', 'Lol, you broke this ruler specifically for the challenge?Nice idea and I like the colors, but the centimeters are betraying you here a little bit. I think the rulers are all the same size, but the fact that the first and second go to 30 and 60, but the third goes to 91 is affecting my perception of the symmetry. Its a minor nitpick though', '2010-04-05 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932113, 863881, 115307, '<td valign="top">Well done! I know that this has been done before, but the concept works beautifully for this challenge, and it was executed very well. 8</td>', 'Well done! I know that this has been done before, but the concept works beautifully for this challenge, and it was executed very well. 8', '2010-04-05 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932116, 864506, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love the colors and especially the sky in this photo! For such a simple photo with not much going on, it is very visually pleasing. Well done!</td>', 'Wow, I love the colors and especially the sky in this photo! For such a simple photo with not much going on, it is very visually pleasing. Well done!', '2010-04-05 16:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
