(5932119, 865181, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like that there are bubbles in the bottles. It makes this image a lot more interesting than it would be if there were just the three bottles.<br/>I am assuming you did this on purpose and shook them up...</td>', 'I like that there are bubbles in the bottles. It makes this image a lot more interesting than it would be if there were just the three bottles.I am assuming you did this on purpose and shook them up...', '2010-04-05 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932123, 864740, 115307, '<td valign="top">So, I am sorry about this, but I just can''t give you a good score, based purely on personal taste.<br/>There are 3 subjects and they take equal importance, but I find feet absolutely gross! And no matter how hard I try, I cannot look past that.</td>', 'So, I am sorry about this, but I just can''t give you a good score, based purely on personal taste.There are 3 subjects and they take equal importance, but I find feet absolutely gross! And no matter how hard I try, I cannot look past that.', '2010-04-05 16:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932130, 864943, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry, composition, and colors.<br/>My only tiny nitpick (that doesn''t affect your score at all) is that the top flower is intersecting the leaf of the second, and I wish that they were just slightly separated so that that didn''t happen.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry, composition, and colors.My only tiny nitpick (that doesn''t affect your score at all) is that the top flower is intersecting the leaf of the second, and I wish that they were just slightly separated so that that didn''t happen.', '2010-04-05 16:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932134, 864532, 115307, '<td valign="top">While there is technically not much wrong with the photo, I do not think that the three things in this photo carry equal weight at all. The buildings become background for the "weird red thing"</td>', 'While there is technically not much wrong with the photo, I do not think that the three things in this photo carry equal weight at all. The buildings become background for the "weird red thing"', '2010-04-05 16:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932139, 864198, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo! I love it!<br/>I hope nitpicky people don''t dislike this because there are only 2 seeds. To me there are clearly 3 elements, and the detail in all of them is phenomenal. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous photo! I love it!I hope nitpicky people don''t dislike this because there are only 2 seeds. To me there are clearly 3 elements, and the detail in all of them is phenomenal. 9', '2010-04-05 16:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932144, 865151, 115307, '<td valign="top">So, I am extremely jealous of this photo. I love photographing flowers and personally think I have achieved some very nice shots of them. But never have I taken a photo with this much focus and detail! Fantastic colors and lighting as well! 9</td>', 'So, I am extremely jealous of this photo. I love photographing flowers and personally think I have achieved some very nice shots of them. But never have I taken a photo with this much focus and detail! Fantastic colors and lighting as well! 9', '2010-04-05 16:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932145, 865173, 10785, '<td valign="top">A good everyday subject with objects that go together photographed well. Good lighting and no apparent reflections causing distractions. It appears there are some jpg compression around the mug handle and the spoon handle causing the Jaggies. The frame is different. I like the off white simulated matting but I would have made the outer line a dark blue or silver and kept it in line with the tones already in the image rather than add the gold.</td>', 'A good everyday subject with objects that go together photographed well. Good lighting and no apparent reflections causing distractions. It appears there are some jpg compression around the mug handle and the spoon handle causing the Jaggies. The frame is different. I like the off white simulated matting but I would have made the outer line a dark blue or silver and kept it in line with the tones already in the image rather than add the gold.', '2010-04-05 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932226, 864634, 96881, '<td valign="top">While I can see the three elements, and can understand what you were trying to achieve with this photo, it does not really meet the challenge.  The front flower, in the most prominent position, and in focus, is clearly the subject of the image, while the two other flowers are supporting elements.  The idea of this challenge was that the three elements were equal.  Having the centre placed flower in focus, with the oother two, on the line of third, but maybe OOF, would have met this.  However, I feel your score will suffer as people will think that one flower is definitely ''more equal that others"</td>', 'While I can see the three elements, and can understand what you were trying to achieve with this photo, it does not really meet the challenge.  The front flower, in the most prominent position, and in focus, is clearly the subject of the image, while the two other flowers are supporting elements.  The idea of this challenge was that the three elements were equal.  Having the centre placed flower in focus, with the oother two, on the line of third, but maybe OOF, would have met this.  However, I feel your score will suffer as people will think that one flower is definitely ''more equal that others"', '2010-04-05 17:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932231, 864932, 96881, '<td valign="top">you obviously are much better at getting animals to do what you want than me........My well Trained Dog always became an undisciplined nightmare as soon as the camera came out (but never licked the lens).....Would have been great if the rightmost goat stood a little straighter so that it was not behind the horns of its mate, however, a nice image that means the challenge well</td>', 'you obviously are much better at getting animals to do what you want than me........My well Trained Dog always became an undisciplined nightmare as soon as the camera came out (but never licked the lens).....Would have been great if the rightmost goat stood a little straighter so that it was not behind the horns of its mate, however, a nice image that means the challenge well', '2010-04-05 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932233, 865030, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that is an American sandwich, cause I have never heard of it............A better organization, putting elements diagonally would have improved this, also some better lighting to remove the reflections off the table, or using some form of background (black) would have helped as well</td>', 'I am guessing that is an American sandwich, cause I have never heard of it............A better organization, putting elements diagonally would have improved this, also some better lighting to remove the reflections off the table, or using some form of background (black) would have helped as well', '2010-04-05 17:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932274, 864921, 113419, '<td valign="top">I find the chairs in the background distracting</td>', 'I find the chairs in the background distracting', '2010-04-05 18:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932308, 864699, 10523, '<td valign="top">adorable- top 5</td>', 'adorable- top 5', '2010-04-05 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1);
