(5932340, 865066, 67844, '<td valign="top">Well shot, well edited but just a touch on the boring side. Good work though.</td>', 'Well shot, well edited but just a touch on the boring side. Good work though.', '2010-04-05 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932341, 864876, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!    (not voting)</td>', 'LOL!    (not voting)', '2010-04-05 20:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932342, 865100, 67844, '<td valign="top">I like this. Maybe a touch too much saturation in the trees but otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I like this. Maybe a touch too much saturation in the trees but otherwise very nice.', '2010-04-05 20:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932343, 864314, 67844, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice.</td>', 'Simple and nice.', '2010-04-05 20:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932344, 864768, 67844, '<td valign="top">I think technically it is "Man in Red" :)</td>', 'I think technically it is "Man in Red" :)', '2010-04-05 20:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932350, 864698, 67844, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the b&amp;w treatment. Otherwise it is a decent photo.</td>', 'I don''t care for the b&w treatment. Otherwise it is a decent photo.', '2010-04-05 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932352, 864805, 67844, '<td valign="top">As an abstract this is fine but as a photo with 3 subjects, I think it falls short.</td>', 'As an abstract this is fine but as a photo with 3 subjects, I think it falls short.', '2010-04-05 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932353, 865083, 67844, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry but a little bit uninteresting.</td>', 'Nice symmetry but a little bit uninteresting.', '2010-04-05 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932357, 864932, 67844, '<td valign="top">The background grass blurring is odd and takes my attention away from the "3". Maybe from a sharpness adjustment?</td>', 'The background grass blurring is odd and takes my attention away from the "3". Maybe from a sharpness adjustment?', '2010-04-05 20:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932360, 865170, 67844, '<td valign="top">It looks like there is a little bit of blue left in the sky, or the gray is just nice. Either way nice editing.</td>', 'It looks like there is a little bit of blue left in the sky, or the gray is just nice. Either way nice editing.', '2010-04-05 20:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932361, 865059, 67844, '<td valign="top">I wish this was in color and that the flowers were a nice bright color on the black background.</td>', 'I wish this was in color and that the flowers were a nice bright color on the black background.', '2010-04-05 20:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932363, 863939, 67844, '<td valign="top">This one made me chuckle a bit. Too bad it wasn''t titled "Booze, Fags and Sex" ;)</td>', 'This one made me chuckle a bit. Too bad it wasn''t titled "Booze, Fags and Sex" ;)', '2010-04-05 20:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932383, 864878, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good photo with good composition showing the flowers filling the frame. One thing it is lacking is contrast. It looks like the contast was lowered or not adjusted. That in turn dulls the color giving everything a grey overtone and minimum depth due to lack of contrasting highlights and shadows. Pump that up a little bit and this gets much better.</td>', 'I think this is a good photo with good composition showing the flowers filling the frame. One thing it is lacking is contrast. It looks like the contast was lowered or not adjusted. That in turn dulls the color giving everything a grey overtone and minimum depth due to lack of contrasting highlights and shadows. Pump that up a little bit and this gets much better.', '2010-04-05 20:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932386, 865170, 10785, '<td valign="top">Cool find with the natural frame!</td>', 'Cool find with the natural frame!', '2010-04-05 20:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932388, 864916, 10785, '<td valign="top">As much as I try to open my mind and bend it outside the corners of the box that is the challenge description, I just can''t see how this fits the challenge...<br/> <br/>Otherwise, the colors are lovely and the reflection is good. Despite a little dust on the mirror and the shot being off center so much for no apparent reason, this is a very good photo.</td>', 'As much as I try to open my mind and bend it outside the corners of the box that is the challenge description, I just can''t see how this fits the challenge... Otherwise, the colors are lovely and the reflection is good. Despite a little dust on the mirror and the shot being off center so much for no apparent reason, this is a very good photo.', '2010-04-05 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932394, 865168, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good study of light and shadows. It oculd benefit from a less textured background that is not a neutral color.</td>', 'Good study of light and shadows. It oculd benefit from a less textured background that is not a neutral color.', '2010-04-05 20:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932428, 864795, 81530, '<td valign="top">Winner!</td>', 'Winner!', '2010-04-05 21:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932430, 865100, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot. This has to be a ribbon.</td>', 'Great shot. This has to be a ribbon.', '2010-04-05 21:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932454, 865083, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture with rich color and excellent composition that unfortunately is suffering badly from the jpeg compression jaggies! The edges of the crosses are all jaggedy pixels...</td>', 'Awesome picture with rich color and excellent composition that unfortunately is suffering badly from the jpeg compression jaggies! The edges of the crosses are all jaggedy pixels...', '2010-04-05 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932459, 864796, 10785, '<td valign="top">I was a bit freaked out by the (CW) in the title because of the recent voting scandal. I was thinking there was some collusion going on and didn''t like it too much, especially since I had seen two images in the PTA challenge recently with the same thing. I was thinking it was a sign to show who you were... But I looked it up and found that it stands for comments wanted. So my initial comment is that I didn''t like this experiemt in communicating with the voters through the title.<br/> <br/>About the picture... good diffuse lighting. I think you might need some reflected light hitting the bottom of the peppers to light them up a bit more. Great color!</td>', 'I was a bit freaked out by the (CW) in the title because of the recent voting scandal. I was thinking there was some collusion going on and didn''t like it too much, especially since I had seen two images in the PTA challenge recently with the same thing. I was thinking it was a sign to show who you were... But I looked it up and found that it stands for comments wanted. So my initial comment is that I didn''t like this experiemt in communicating with the voters through the title. About the picture... good diffuse lighting. I think you might need some reflected light hitting the bottom of the peppers to light them up a bit more. Great color!', '2010-04-05 21:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932464, 865030, 10785, '<td valign="top">Honest feedback: Set up the shot so the background encompasses the entire frame. The right corner shows the edge of the table. Work on the color balance because it is pretty orange. (Perhaps because there is a lot of reds in the picture and possible use of wrong white balance setting.) The fill flash is pretty good here with no real hot spots.. good job on that. I think you used a high ISO because there is a lot of noise which could have been reduced with better lighting. (BTW: My wife loves fluff sandwiches without the peanut butter.)</td>', 'Honest feedback: Set up the shot so the background encompasses the entire frame. The right corner shows the edge of the table. Work on the color balance because it is pretty orange. (Perhaps because there is a lot of reds in the picture and possible use of wrong white balance setting.) The fill flash is pretty good here with no real hot spots.. good job on that. I think you used a high ISO because there is a lot of noise which could have been reduced with better lighting. (BTW: My wife loves fluff sandwiches without the peanut butter.)', '2010-04-05 22:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932465, 864870, 10785, '<td valign="top">I thnk this is too bright. The lighting is white hot!</td>', 'I thnk this is too bright. The lighting is white hot!', '2010-04-05 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932492, 865015, 103032, '<td valign="top">LOL; average woody, steroid woody, anorexic woody.  Creative, lightings good, nicely focused.  Nice work.</td>', 'LOL; average woody, steroid woody, anorexic woody.  Creative, lightings good, nicely focused.  Nice work.', '2010-04-05 22:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932512, 864944, 103032, '<td valign="top">Creative, nice idea, nicely done.  (And they all have tats, good eye for details re: model selection...)</td>', 'Creative, nice idea, nicely done.  (And they all have tats, good eye for details re: model selection...)', '2010-04-05 22:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
