(5932625, 865008, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like what you did with the edging on this...you have a great shot...it is clear and your colors are well done...but, I see the horseman in the front first then the two in the back...I''m not seeing them equally...if they had been side by side then that would have worked but my eye is drawn to the one in the front first</td>', 'I really like what you did with the edging on this...you have a great shot...it is clear and your colors are well done...but, I see the horseman in the front first then the two in the back...I''m not seeing them equally...if they had been side by side then that would have worked but my eye is drawn to the one in the front first', '2010-04-05 23:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932643, 864634, 98339, '<td valign="top">when I am looking at this I see the first flower (the one in focus) then I see the ones in the background...to me my eye isn''t seeing them (all three) equally.  that given...you have a very beautiful shot...I do love the background</td>', 'when I am looking at this I see the first flower (the one in focus) then I see the ones in the background...to me my eye isn''t seeing them (all three) equally.  that given...you have a very beautiful shot...I do love the background', '2010-04-05 23:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932644, 865181, 98339, '<td valign="top">though I see your subjects very equally, they just aren''t the most interesting...you do have super sharp focus I will say</td>', 'though I see your subjects very equally, they just aren''t the most interesting...you do have super sharp focus I will say', '2010-04-05 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5932645, 864943, 100831, '<td valign="top">very nice cascade of three. Wonderfully bright colors and the focus is crystal clear!! Excellent photo.</td>', 'very nice cascade of three. Wonderfully bright colors and the focus is crystal clear!! Excellent photo.', '2010-04-05 23:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
