(5933991, 864854, 67844, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better on a clean white table and background, lit in a way that made the crystals glow more to show off the vibrant colors. Here the colors seem a bit muted.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better on a clean white table and background, lit in a way that made the crystals glow more to show off the vibrant colors. Here the colors seem a bit muted.', '2010-04-06 19:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933993, 864796, 67844, '<td valign="top">Well shot and well lit but I don''t care for the arrangement. They seem crowded.</td>', 'Well shot and well lit but I don''t care for the arrangement. They seem crowded.', '2010-04-06 19:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933995, 865068, 67844, '<td valign="top">This may be a spiritual/emotional image to some but to me is it just an odd shot of some guy carrying some lumber while a UPS truck drives by. It is not artfully interesting, nor is is a very good shot.</td>', 'This may be a spiritual/emotional image to some but to me is it just an odd shot of some guy carrying some lumber while a UPS truck drives by. It is not artfully interesting, nor is is a very good shot.', '2010-04-06 19:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933997, 864916, 67844, '<td valign="top">I see 2 cups and 2 reflections. Where is the 3rd?</td>', 'I see 2 cups and 2 reflections. Where is the 3rd?', '2010-04-06 19:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5933998, 864198, 67844, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and well edited. If there would have only been 3 seeds ...</td>', 'Very nice shot and well edited. If there would have only been 3 seeds ...', '2010-04-06 19:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
