(5934003, 864981, 67844, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition of this, though I am not sure what I would do different. Maybe angles them and put them more in a corner or something. It is just too in your face as it is.</td>', 'I don''t like the composition of this, though I am not sure what I would do different. Maybe angles them and put them more in a corner or something. It is just too in your face as it is.', '2010-04-06 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
