(5935828, 864558, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. Much more creative than most in this challenge. The image is clean and interesting!<br/>The funny thing is, that I like this picture better as a thumb than up close. It is much easier to focus on the spaces rather than the fork.<br/>Up close I really have to work at it :-)<br/>There is some reflections on the fork that are somewhat distracting. Completely black might have worked a little better.</td>', 'I love the idea. Much more creative than most in this challenge. The image is clean and interesting!The funny thing is, that I like this picture better as a thumb than up close. It is much easier to focus on the spaces rather than the fork.Up close I really have to work at it :-)There is some reflections on the fork that are somewhat distracting. Completely black might have worked a little better.', '2010-04-07 17:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
