(5935993, 864879, 67844, '<td valign="top">Although I can''t say I love this crop, the photo is very well done. Everything is well proportioned, well lit and in focus. I do like though.</td>', 'Although I can''t say I love this crop, the photo is very well done. Everything is well proportioned, well lit and in focus. I do like though.', '2010-04-07 18:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5935997, 865038, 67844, '<td valign="top">The editing in this makes it look like a painting and I like it. It is bright and colorful but not overdone and the lighting is just perfect. Very nice for sure!</td>', 'The editing in this makes it look like a painting and I like it. It is bright and colorful but not overdone and the lighting is just perfect. Very nice for sure!', '2010-04-07 18:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
