(5937887, 865183, 115096, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic! Great pic! My only complaint is it looks like you dragged the center of the levels to far to one side causing some flattened colors in the sky and background grass.</td>', 'Very dynamic! Great pic! My only complaint is it looks like you dragged the center of the levels to far to one side causing some flattened colors in the sky and background grass.', '2010-04-08 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937908, 864198, 103142, '<td valign="top">lol!! I almost entered this: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=864960" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_864960.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_864960.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/100000-104999/103142/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_864960.jpg"/></a> -- Great minds think alike! I like the base where the seeds are sitting on yours -- nice detail (not voting yet)</td>', 'lol!! I almost entered this:  -- Great minds think alike! I like the base where the seeds are sitting on yours -- nice detail (not voting yet)', '2010-04-08 20:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937910, 864916, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry, but I''m having a really hard time getting three out of this... I see two, and I see four, but I have no idea what 3 would be...  Sorry!</td>', 'I''m so sorry, but I''m having a really hard time getting three out of this... I see two, and I see four, but I have no idea what 3 would be...  Sorry!', '2010-04-08 20:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937911, 864912, 103142, '<td valign="top">At first, I thought "that''s really pushing it...", but when you look further and add the dividing lines into the mix, you have the three different strata, and it works.</td>', 'At first, I thought "that''s really pushing it...", but when you look further and add the dividing lines into the mix, you have the three different strata, and it works.', '2010-04-08 20:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937912, 864971, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice shot, and I love bread, but it''s so incredibly yellow on my screen, it makes the bread look unappealing.</td>', 'nice shot, and I love bread, but it''s so incredibly yellow on my screen, it makes the bread look unappealing.', '2010-04-08 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937913, 864169, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a great capture, but the partial head on the left and on the right are quite distracting. Nothing much you can do about it, but it lessens an otherwise interesting shot.</td>', 'It''s a great capture, but the partial head on the left and on the right are quite distracting. Nothing much you can do about it, but it lessens an otherwise interesting shot.', '2010-04-08 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937915, 865030, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but on my screen this is incredibly oversaturated.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but on my screen this is incredibly oversaturated.', '2010-04-08 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937917, 863961, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but even though there are only three fish in the foreground, there is the fourth one in the back, and it actually draws the eye. I''m sorry, DNMC, imo.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but even though there are only three fish in the foreground, there is the fourth one in the back, and it actually draws the eye. I''m sorry, DNMC, imo.', '2010-04-08 20:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937918, 863851, 103142, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better without the reflections. They''re so pale, it doesn''t really add much interest, imo.  Sorry!</td>', 'Would have liked this better without the reflections. They''re so pale, it doesn''t really add much interest, imo.  Sorry!', '2010-04-08 20:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937920, 865137, 103142, '<td valign="top">Great shot!! But then again, I''m partial to gulls... :)</td>', 'Great shot!! But then again, I''m partial to gulls... :)', '2010-04-08 20:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937927, 864784, 103142, '<td valign="top">Couple of things: <br/> <br/>nit pick -- the fish isn''t really equivalent, he blends in, and I didn''t particularly notice him until I read the title. It doesn''t really affect my vote, however. <br/> <br/>It seems very oversaturated on my monitor. And I wish the angle was a little more from the right so that you could see more than just the back of the female''s head.</td>', 'Couple of things:  nit pick -- the fish isn''t really equivalent, he blends in, and I didn''t particularly notice him until I read the title. It doesn''t really affect my vote, however.  It seems very oversaturated on my monitor. And I wish the angle was a little more from the right so that you could see more than just the back of the female''s head.', '2010-04-08 20:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937928, 864904, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m so sorry, but there''s just too many subjects. I looked at the picture before I read the title, and I would have thought your subjects were the shoe, helmet and cycle, or perhaps shoe, cycle and truck. It really was more of an all things being equal: five.<br/> <br/>Sorry, DNMC, imo.</td>', 'I''m so sorry, but there''s just too many subjects. I looked at the picture before I read the title, and I would have thought your subjects were the shoe, helmet and cycle, or perhaps shoe, cycle and truck. It really was more of an all things being equal: five. Sorry, DNMC, imo.', '2010-04-08 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937931, 864558, 103142, '<td valign="top">sorry -- that''s really pushing it, imo. I think you should be able to look a a picture and have a vague idea of what the challenge is about. I had no idea what your three was until I looked at the title. Imo, DNMC.<br/> <br/>However, that being said, I think it''s a very interesting, very intriguing photo. I wish it was in free study, or someplace that it fit a little more.  So sorry!</td>', 'sorry -- that''s really pushing it, imo. I think you should be able to look a a picture and have a vague idea of what the challenge is about. I had no idea what your three was until I looked at the title. Imo, DNMC. However, that being said, I think it''s a very interesting, very intriguing photo. I wish it was in free study, or someplace that it fit a little more.  So sorry!', '2010-04-08 20:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5937932, 864710, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if you''ve done something like this before... It looks very familiar. Anyway, I think it''s spectacular!  10</td>', 'I''m wondering if you''ve done something like this before... It looks very familiar. Anyway, I think it''s spectacular!  10', '2010-04-08 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
