(5938983, 865158, 12796, '<td valign="top">it appears to me that you are shouting <b>please punish me for out of focus</b> Composition is excellent with the gesture made by the crows(?), but provided you had a second chance to shoot soon after this before the birds flew away, I would have liked a shot a little from the right so that the third bird would not be covered by the branch like how it is in this photo.</td>', 'it appears to me that you are shouting please punish me for out of focus Composition is excellent with the gesture made by the crows(?), but provided you had a second chance to shoot soon after this before the birds flew away, I would have liked a shot a little from the right so that the third bird would not be covered by the branch like how it is in this photo.', '2010-04-09 22:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5938993, 864609, 12796, '<td valign="top">3+3=6 agreed. 3 subjects + 3 reflections of subject. but sorry that the photo fails to communicate the strength of this photo. I am a strong believer that unless the eye of the subjects are not visible, portrait always comes out a low-key.</td>', '3+3=6 agreed. 3 subjects + 3 reflections of subject. but sorry that the photo fails to communicate the strength of this photo. I am a strong believer that unless the eye of the subjects are not visible, portrait always comes out a low-key.', '2010-04-09 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939005, 865083, 12796, '<td valign="top">great. but is it just me that the left and right cross borders (towards the sides) looks a bit staggered (some kind of weird pixelation). A very powerful dark blue sky with decent clouds. Easter has just gone by and so the subject adds a little more value addition to the shot. But it appears to me that the right cross and the left cross is differently saturated. The left one gives more prominent feel of wood being brown whilst the right one appears slightly desaturated.</td>', 'great. but is it just me that the left and right cross borders (towards the sides) looks a bit staggered (some kind of weird pixelation). A very powerful dark blue sky with decent clouds. Easter has just gone by and so the subject adds a little more value addition to the shot. But it appears to me that the right cross and the left cross is differently saturated. The left one gives more prominent feel of wood being brown whilst the right one appears slightly desaturated.', '2010-04-09 22:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939019, 864933, 12796, '<td valign="top">Is it photograph of a design on some shower glass or using some plugin you had converted your photo into a colour canvas. Former you do not have any choice, latter I would say poor choice.<br/> <br/>Anyways since we voters do not have the option to even know what could be the scenario, we have to go on the basis of appeal. <br/>Fits Challenge? Yes. <br/>How Impressed? Not Much, Either over processed or photograph of an art work. But excellent lighting<br/>Additional Thoughts: I strongly would have preffered three different subjects rather than going for similar entries as in last challenge titled "three". Three different flowers aren''t three subjects in my way of consideration. 3 People, Yes, but 3 Flowers, Sorry not much.</td>', 'Is it photograph of a design on some shower glass or using some plugin you had converted your photo into a colour canvas. Former you do not have any choice, latter I would say poor choice. Anyways since we voters do not have the option to even know what could be the scenario, we have to go on the basis of appeal. Fits Challenge? Yes. How Impressed? Not Much, Either over processed or photograph of an art work. But excellent lightingAdditional Thoughts: I strongly would have preffered three different subjects rather than going for similar entries as in last challenge titled "three". Three different flowers aren''t three subjects in my way of consideration. 3 People, Yes, but 3 Flowers, Sorry not much.', '2010-04-09 22:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939026, 864827, 12796, '<td valign="top">this photo really evokes a different feeling in me. Suggests the determination of someone to enjoy the beauty of this world. Why a tricycle without much seating capacity? a physically challenged person? But why at this location? A mineral water can possibly 15 or 20 ltrs suggest how long this trip would last. all connects really well and the feeling evoked in me is really strong. Congrats.</td>', 'this photo really evokes a different feeling in me. Suggests the determination of someone to enjoy the beauty of this world. Why a tricycle without much seating capacity? a physically challenged person? But why at this location? A mineral water can possibly 15 or 20 ltrs suggest how long this trip would last. all connects really well and the feeling evoked in me is really strong. Congrats.', '2010-04-09 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939031, 864795, 12796, '<td valign="top">great balance. I like this. different from <i>often copied but less appealing</i>. Congrats and all the best.</td>', 'great balance. I like this. different from often copied but less appealing. Congrats and all the best.', '2010-04-09 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939032, 864916, 12796, '<td valign="top">precisely. i don''t understand the 3rd subject here. does mirror appear to me as a 3rd subject? No. But yes as a tool to expand your subjects appeal, but still 1 cup with 1 reflection is considered as 1 subject being showcased in a better way. your title also revolves around <b>2</b></td>', 'precisely. i don''t understand the 3rd subject here. does mirror appear to me as a 3rd subject? No. But yes as a tool to expand your subjects appeal, but still 1 cup with 1 reflection is considered as 1 subject being showcased in a better way. your title also revolves around 2', '2010-04-09 22:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939034, 865107, 12796, '<td valign="top">good title. but not flattered with the photo much. I had been telling in other photos how much I would have liked to see three different subjects. Unlike people, <i>n</i> number of flowers do not mean <i>n</i> number of subjects to me. Flowers do not personify very well unless until you specifically try to do so.</td>', 'good title. but not flattered with the photo much. I had been telling in other photos how much I would have liked to see three different subjects. Unlike people, n number of flowers do not mean n number of subjects to me. Flowers do not personify very well unless until you specifically try to do so.', '2010-04-09 22:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5939035, 864828, 12796, '<td valign="top">i like this, but the orange ballooon is a major distraction (small element but due to its colour it is a major distraction), but as far as your 3 subjects are considered, all I can say is <b>PERFECT CHOICE</b></td>', 'i like this, but the orange ballooon is a major distraction (small element but due to its colour it is a major distraction), but as far as your 3 subjects are considered, all I can say is PERFECT CHOICE', '2010-04-09 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
