(5939886, 865167, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but harsh, unflattering lighting is really hurting it. Onboard flash?</td>', 'Great concept, but harsh, unflattering lighting is really hurting it. Onboard flash?', '2010-04-11 02:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
