(5940368, 865183, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. A much more moody and interesting shot than my Yucca seed pod.. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=842436" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/112828/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842436.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/112828/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842436.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/112828/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_842436.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Very nice.. A much more moody and interesting shot than my Yucca seed pod.. ', '2010-04-11 17:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
