(5940493, 863862, 100393, '<td valign="top">I was keyboard voting and it recorded my provisional 2 - I think the POV makes it worth more than that as does the focus on the potted ball.<br/> <br/>The motion blur works but the lack of clarity of the cloth doesn''t serve you well, the red on the potted ball is quite noisy too.<br/> <br/>I think most people would count more than three elements too.<br/> <br/>Bumping from a 2 to a 4 - I can''t really see more merit than that score in it I''m afraid.</td>', 'I was keyboard voting and it recorded my provisional 2 - I think the POV makes it worth more than that as does the focus on the potted ball. The motion blur works but the lack of clarity of the cloth doesn''t serve you well, the red on the potted ball is quite noisy too. I think most people would count more than three elements too. Bumping from a 2 to a 4 - I can''t really see more merit than that score in it I''m afraid.', '2010-04-11 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
