(5945689, 865100, 72929, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by soup:</b></div><hr/><i> but there are four cowboys at each stall... ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Judi is too annoyed to answer ;) Three cowboys in each stall, three cowboys outside of the stall, three stalls. Hence the title 3 x 3 x 3<br/> <br/>Great capture of the moment which is very fitting for the assignment. Not sure if this is dumb luck/fortuitous or planned.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-04-14 08:43:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by soup: but there are four cowboys at each stall... ?  Judi is too annoyed to answer ;) Three cowboys in each stall, three cowboys outside of the stall, three stalls. Hence the title 3 x 3 x 3 Great capture of the moment which is very fitting for the assignment. Not sure if this is dumb luck/fortuitous or planned.', '2010-04-14 09:42:41.000000', '2010-04-14 09:43:43.000000', 0),
