(5950464, 864981, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>Hello <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=107135" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tinkie2010</a>!  What flamboyant and lush roses you grow in South Africa!<br/> <br/>Gorgeous colors in those roses certainly draw attention to them right away.  It is unfortunate that the orange/brown background and those very green leaves compete for attention.  If they had stayed muted in the background one could appreciate the roses more.  <br/> <br/>You selected roses that were ''past their prime'' and accentuated that fact in your composition.  This added originality to your composition and was a delight to note.<br/> <br/>best regards,<br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  Hello  tinkie2010!  What flamboyant and lush roses you grow in South Africa! Gorgeous colors in those roses certainly draw attention to them right away.  It is unfortunate that the orange/brown background and those very green leaves compete for attention.  If they had stayed muted in the background one could appreciate the roses more.   You selected roses that were ''past their prime'' and accentuated that fact in your composition.  This added originality to your composition and was a delight to note. best regards, Alice', '2010-04-17 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 0),
